{
 "duration": 24.789,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the rocky climb, Owen carried his water bottle in one hand.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 4.01
  },
  {
   "text": "Every time the trail got steep, he had only one hand left for the rock.",
   "start": 4.31,
   "end": 8.256
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 8.556,
   "end": 9.483
  },
  {
   "text": "Slide the bottle into an insulated sleeve on a shoulder strap and wear it across your body.",
   "start": 9.783,
   "end": 14.96
  },
  {
   "text": "Both hands stay free, the water stays at your hip,",
   "start": 15.26,
   "end": 18.069
  },
  {
   "text": "and the neoprene slows it from freezing.",
   "start": 18.369,
   "end": 20.325
  },
  {
   "text": "He reached the top with both hands.",
   "start": 20.625,
   "end": 22.373
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next climb.",
   "start": 22.873,
   "end": 24.589
  }
 ],
